(g)
habitual breach of any law applicable to the establishment;
(h)
riotous or any act subversive of discipline;
(i)
habitual negligence or neglect of work;
(j)
frequent repetition of any act or omission for which a fine may be imposed to a maximum of 2 per cent of the wages in a
month;
(k)
striking work or inciting others to strike work in contravention of the provisions of any law, or Rule having the force of
